<title>USA: Hollywood Park, Boomtown merge.</title>
<headline>Hollywood Park, Boomtown merge.</headline>
<dateline>INGLEWOOD, Calif. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hollywood Park Inc and Boomtown Inc completed their merger of thoroughbred horse racing tracks and gambling facilites, effective June 30.</p>
<p>Hollywood Park owns a race track and card clubs in southern California and a race track in Arizona. Boomtown owns casinos in Nevada, Louisiana and Mississippi.</p>
<p>&quot;Hollywood Park's access to capital will allow us to maximize the potential of the Boomtown properties.&quot; said R. D. Hubbard, chief executive. &quot;At a time of consolidation in the gaming industry, we intend to acquire other companies with profitable properties.&quot; The two proposed their merger in 1996.</p>
</text>
